sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant JWT as JWT Verifier
    participant SVC as Backend Service

    App->>GW: GET /api/v1/content/bookmarks
    GW->>JWT: Verify Authorization Bearer token
    alt Token valid
        JWT-->>GW: user_id, account_type, scopes
        GW->>GW: Add auth context headers
        GW->>SVC: Proxy request
        SVC-->>GW: Service response
        GW-->>App: 200 OK
    else Token invalid or missing
        JWT-->>GW: Auth error
        GW-->>App: 401 Unauthorized
    end
